OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in Boris Johnson
OL,4,Awedding plot trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been discharged after
OL,7,Ffailing to reach a verdict in the trial
OL,8,Fof a man accused of plotting to disrupt
OL,9,FBoris Johnson's wedding reception.
OL,11,FTim Speers, 41, allegedly carried spray
OL,12,Fpaint and superglue to the Doylesford
OL,13,FEstate in Gloucestershire on 29 July
OL,14,F2022, on the eve of the former prime
OL,15,Fminister and Carrie Johnson's wedding
OL,16,Freception.
OL,18,FSpeers, from Bude, Cornwall, denied
OL,19,Fhaving items with intent to cause
OL,20,Fcriminal damage and said he abandoned
OL,21,Fthe idea to spray "Palestine" on the
OL,22,Flawn by the time police approached him.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
