OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in Boris Johnson
OL,4,Awedding plot trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge discharged the jury and
OL,7,Fadjourned the case at Southwark Crown
OL,8,FCourt until 29 September, when
OL,9,Fprosecutors have been told to indicate
OL,10,Fif they want a retrial.
